WEBVTT

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:03.795
We're almost at Mt. Mud Boat.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.298
By the way, why are we here again?

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:07.883
Um...

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:11.345
This place always has
a lot of UFO sightings,

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:15.724
and most of them seem to happen around
the same time on New Year's Eve.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:20.354
And this phenomenon apparently
occurs every seven years.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:23.565
The last time there was
a sighting was seven years ago.

00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:25.943
At least, that's what this article said.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:29.488
Well, all this information
is rather convenient.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:36.203
You've got this, Mob. We're almost there,
so don't go puking on me.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:39.289
This road sure is something.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:42.167
There's supposed to be
a hiking trail somewhere.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:43.168
Huh?

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.253
What's wrong?

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:48.465
I think we passed the sign
for the hiking trail a ways back...

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:51.635
Uh, why didn't you mention that earlier?

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:51.969
I just thought he was trying to take us
as far as he could with the car.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:55.514
"Licensed driver with little experience: I just thought
he was trying to take us as far as he could with the car.

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:56.139
"Licensed driver with little experience: 10 years" I just
thought he was trying to take us as far as he could with the car.

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:56.348
"Licensed driver with little experience:
10 years"

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:57.057
"Licensed driver with little
experience: 10 years" Ugh!

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:57.391
Ugh!

00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:02.771
We're gonna have to go in reverse until
we find enough space to make a U-turn.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:06.567
It's only 1:30 PM, so there's
probably no reason to hurry.

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:10.821
Yeah, says the guy who was an hour late.

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:12.990
Hey, let's calm down.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:15.409
The UFO's not gonna come if we're too angry.

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:18.287
Huh? Are you mocking me?

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:21.373
And after I canceled my plans
for New Year's Eve to be here.

00:01:21.582 --> 00:01:22.666
The hell'd you just say?

00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:26.753
You were being all pouty,
so we were trying to be nice!

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:27.963
The hell's with that attitude?

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:30.257
N-Now, now...

00:01:35.137 --> 00:01:38.849
Okay, time to put this baby in reverse.

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:40.892
M-Mob!

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:52.863
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:57.951
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:01:58.994 --> 00:02:01.496
I realized that my youth was grey

00:02:01.705 --> 00:02:04.458
The root of this irritation is unknown

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:06.960
My brain runs parallel with this emotional train

00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:10.172
Struggling adolescence

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.008
Don't disturb the subconscious mind

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:15.844
Who's that behind me?

00:02:16.053 --> 00:02:19.473
Opposing ideas, distortion

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:23.101
Purge the sorrow

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:26.647
So, do what you can now.

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:28.774
My life

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.816
Finally

00:02:30.025 --> 00:02:34.071
Break it down!!

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:36.990
(WANT) desire (YOUNG) and sincerity

00:02:37.199 --> 00:02:39.785
(BURN) they begin to sprout (1) within my chest

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:42.579
(TRANCE) I won't awaken (CHANCE) but I want to

00:02:42.788 --> 00:02:45.540
(STANCE) both sides of the coin
(1) are back-to-back

00:02:45.749 --> 00:02:48.335
Accept me as I am

00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:51.546
Conflicting freedom and relations

00:02:51.755 --> 00:02:53.715
If they can become one

00:02:53.924 --> 00:02:55.342
That smile will be

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.177
One and only "1"

00:02:57.386 --> 00:03:02.766
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:02.974
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:03:02.974 --> 00:03:03.975
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:03.975 --> 00:03:04.184
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.644
"Mob Psycho 100 III"
One and only "1"

00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:05.852
"Mob Psycho 100 III"

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.772
"Mob Psycho 100 "
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:08.772 --> 00:03:09.606
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:03:09.815 --> 00:03:12.734
One and only "1"

00:03:13.985 --> 00:03:18.490
"Transmission 2
- Encountering the Unknown~"

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:25.914
Are you okay?

00:03:26.123 --> 00:03:27.958
Thank goodness. There's reception.

00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:32.003
All right. Let's walk back
towards the hiking trail.

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:35.674
I'll come back to get the car later.

00:03:36.717 --> 00:03:39.594
If we're going to walk, why don't we keep
going forward rather than go back?

00:03:39.803 --> 00:03:41.138
Yeah, not happening.

00:03:41.346 --> 00:03:44.599
Amateurs shouldn't walk the game trails
of mountains they're not familiar with.

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:48.145
I won't be able to take any responsibility
if something happens to you kids.

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:52.941
Um... Sorry, I'm gonna go take a piss.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.152
Mob, you should go, too.

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:00.741
They don't seem to be coming back.

00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:02.868
They aren't going number two, are they?

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.704
Did they get lost? I'll go take a look.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:08.957
Hold it. It's dangerous to go alone.
We'll all go together.

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:11.877
--That way?
--No, it's that way.

00:04:22.137 --> 00:04:24.806
Which way did we come from again?

00:04:25.015 --> 00:04:27.934
We've definitely lost the path.

00:04:28.143 --> 00:04:31.438
And now there's no reception.

00:04:31.646 --> 00:04:33.857
Uh, we're probably gonna be
in trouble if it gets dark.

00:04:34.065 --> 00:04:36.318
Sh-Should we head back down?

00:04:36.526 --> 00:04:38.612
Whenever you get lost in the mountains,

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:44.993
I've heard that it's probably safer to head up
the mountain than try to go back down.

00:04:45.202 --> 00:04:49.372
If we can get to a better vantage point,
we should be able to find a route.

00:04:49.581 --> 00:04:50.624
Oh, I see.

00:04:50.832 --> 00:04:54.461
I should've placed more obvious
markers along the way...

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:58.507
He sure seems knowledgeable,
even if he's an amateur.

00:04:58.715 --> 00:05:01.301
Oh, crap! I left the book back in the car.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.427
What? You're kidding.

00:05:02.636 --> 00:05:06.556
The one that has the spell for
the UFO summoning ritual?!

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:10.644
It's no big deal.

00:05:17.818 --> 00:05:19.778
Look, it's the mountain trail.

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:22.697
I think we might just make it
if we keep going!

00:05:22.906 --> 00:05:26.660
Huh? Weren't we heading back?

00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:30.622
We've come this far,
so let's actually summon a UFO!

00:05:30.831 --> 00:05:35.001
Yeah, that's not happening.
We've been messing up left and right all day.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.753
Seriously, Kurata...

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:41.633
Who do you think Inukawa and Saruta
painstakingly planned this all out for?

00:05:41.842 --> 00:05:44.553
What? Really?

00:05:44.761 --> 00:05:47.973
Are you seriously trying to
blame this on me right now?

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:53.478
I disbanded the Telepathy Club because
all of you never tried to do anything!

00:05:53.687 --> 00:05:55.230
Today's no different.

00:05:55.438 --> 00:05:58.441
I kept wondering if I should come or not!

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:01.194
Because I didn't want this
very thing to happen.

00:06:01.403 --> 00:06:05.907
I only came because I believed you
when you said you found a telepathist.

00:06:06.116 --> 00:06:09.536
And yet you had the nerve to lie to me...

00:06:09.744 --> 00:06:16.251
None of you have any idea how I feel
getting my earnest hopes trampled on.

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:19.546
How could you?!

00:06:19.754 --> 00:06:21.756
How could you?!

00:06:23.884 --> 00:06:26.595
Anyway, there's really no point
in arguing right now,

00:06:26.803 --> 00:06:28.263
so why don't we keep on walking?

00:06:28.471 --> 00:06:31.600
No, I'm going home! I'm leaving!

00:06:31.808 --> 00:06:35.312
I'm tired! I'm not climbing any farther!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:39.441
I'll go back alone,
so all of you can keep on going.

00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:43.737
Tome-san. Let's walk together.

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:53.622
Okay, fine. I just need
to keep walking, right?

00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:56.750
All right, let's go.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.559
Man, we're high up.

00:07:14.768 --> 00:07:17.979
--We did it.
--4:19 PM...

00:07:18.188 --> 00:07:21.066
We don't have much time
before the sun's gonna set.

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:26.947
Well... according to the documents,
the UFO usually appears around 5 PM,

00:07:27.155 --> 00:07:29.574
so let's get ready to summon it.

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:35.830
Are we really doing this?
Didn't you forget the book in the car?

00:07:36.039 --> 00:07:39.584
Prez, you were always reading that book.

00:07:39.793 --> 00:07:44.381
You don't have the spell to
summon aliens memorized?

00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:47.801
Of course I don't.

00:07:48.009 --> 00:07:51.805
Isn't it enough that we all climbed
to the top of the mountain together?

00:07:52.013 --> 00:07:54.766
We've already made
plenty of memories today.

00:07:54.975 --> 00:07:57.060
This is a great view.

00:07:58.812 --> 00:08:01.481
What are you doing, Takenaka?

00:08:04.776 --> 00:08:06.277
Ahem...

00:08:07.988 --> 00:08:11.116
Doofa stootoo ayaabagayari...

00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:14.577
Prooha komo hipakaeeh...

00:08:16.663 --> 00:08:20.709
After creating an "8" with the rocks
and setting a foot in either circle,

00:08:20.917 --> 00:08:24.587
close your eyes and chant while facing
in the southwest direction...

00:08:24.796 --> 00:08:26.715
Hands should look like this.

00:08:26.923 --> 00:08:29.509
I know you remember this, Prez.

00:08:30.552 --> 00:08:36.307
I got pretty serious researching all of this
and before I knew it, it was morning.

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:41.229
So... you weren't late because you
overslept from being too nervous?

00:08:41.438 --> 00:08:43.815
This is way too embarrassing to even say.

00:08:44.024 --> 00:08:48.778
The last thing I wanted to do was mess it up,
so I figured I'd do whatever I could.

00:08:48.987 --> 00:08:51.448
You were that serious about this?

00:08:51.656 --> 00:08:52.907
Yeah, I am.

00:08:53.116 --> 00:08:57.203
I decided I'd help out because these three
were so serious about all this.

00:08:57.412 --> 00:09:00.248
So could you believe us already?

00:09:01.124 --> 00:09:02.375
But...

00:09:02.584 --> 00:09:05.920
"Even then, I'm scared of this going wrong.

00:09:06.129 --> 00:09:11.217
It's probably better to limit this
to chasing a fantasy.

00:09:11.426 --> 00:09:15.597
Maybe all that matters in this
is whether we had fun.

00:09:15.805 --> 00:09:21.311
Because my other memories
with everyone may all end up a joke, too.

00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:25.982
We almost got lost in the mountains
because I'm forcing my delusions on them.

00:09:26.191 --> 00:09:30.403
I don't want to face reality
any more than this." Apparently.

00:09:30.612 --> 00:09:34.657
No way! We don't think
you're forcing your delusions on us.

00:09:34.866 --> 00:09:37.202
This is something we wanted to do!

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.997
Before the Telepathy Club disbands.

00:09:41.206 --> 00:09:43.333
Boys...

00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:47.003
Then... Then you should've
just said so earlier!

00:09:47.212 --> 00:09:48.838
Would it kill her to be honest?

00:09:49.047 --> 00:09:51.257
If that's the case, we're all doing this.

00:09:51.466 --> 00:09:54.135
Come on, start lining up those rocks.

00:09:54.344 --> 00:09:56.805
Doofa stootoo ayaabagayari...

00:09:57.013 --> 00:09:59.641
Prooha komo hipakaeeh...

00:09:59.849 --> 00:10:02.435
Doofa stootoo ayaabagayari...

00:10:02.644 --> 00:10:04.437
--Prooha komo hipakaeeh...
--Master?

00:10:04.646 --> 00:10:07.565
You said you researched this
all last night, right?

00:10:07.774 --> 00:10:10.568
Are you sure you didn't
find out anything else?

00:10:10.777 --> 00:10:13.571
Huh? Is your master
a telepathist, too?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.616
No, I am not a telepathist...

00:10:16.825 --> 00:10:21.162
...but I can read minds by observing
the subtle changes in your aura.

00:10:21.371 --> 00:10:22.997
Apparently, he's the kind
of guy that's a total liar

00:10:23.206 --> 00:10:26.292
but is good at reading people through
their actions and mannerisms.

00:10:26.501 --> 00:10:31.631
Well, Takenaka?
Are you hiding anything else?

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:37.387
Well, the author of that occult book
was arrested two years ago for fraud.

00:10:37.595 --> 00:10:41.474
The research in that book has no basis.

00:10:41.683 --> 00:10:43.476
Even this ritual is completely fake.

00:10:43.685 --> 00:10:45.019
Seriously?

00:10:45.228 --> 00:10:47.438
So you're saying this is pointless?

00:10:47.647 --> 00:10:49.065
What the hell?

00:10:49.274 --> 00:10:51.943
I-I'm sorry I didn't tell you sooner.

00:10:52.152 --> 00:10:56.698
I figured there was purpose in
the Telepathy Club working together, though.

00:10:56.906 --> 00:10:58.449
And you're exactly right.

00:10:58.658 --> 00:11:01.035
It's always worth it to do your best.

00:11:01.244 --> 00:11:04.539
All of you ended up gathering
information and took action.

00:11:04.747 --> 00:11:06.249
That's pretty impressive.

00:11:06.457 --> 00:11:11.337
I'm sure this whole thing will always
be a precious memory of your youth.

00:11:11.546 --> 00:11:16.176
It will always remain an important
experience in your hearts.

00:11:16.384 --> 00:11:18.928
And you should be proud of that.

00:11:19.137 --> 00:11:22.265
Y-You're right. We all did our best.

00:11:22.473 --> 00:11:23.808
Y-Yeah.

00:11:24.017 --> 00:11:25.852
There's no denying that
we actually did work hard.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:26.978
I guess...

00:11:27.187 --> 00:11:30.940
All right. It's getting pretty dark,
so let's head back.

00:11:31.149 --> 00:11:35.278
What about the UFO sightings?
Were those also fake?

00:11:35.486 --> 00:11:38.114
No, apparently those really happened.

00:11:38.323 --> 00:11:39.908
I see.

00:11:46.247 --> 00:11:49.584
Then let's do it.
We haven't tried everything yet.

00:11:51.878 --> 00:11:53.504
Let's send out a telepathic message.

00:11:53.713 --> 00:11:57.300
I'll give it my all, too,
so let's all try again.

00:11:57.508 --> 00:11:59.052
Mob-kun...

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.387
Prez, do you want to try it?

00:12:01.596 --> 00:12:02.972
--Let's do it.
--Yeah.

00:12:03.181 --> 00:12:04.807
Come on, President Kurata.

00:12:05.016 --> 00:12:08.394
Boys... Thank you.

00:12:35.964 --> 00:12:38.007
Don't try moving too much.

00:12:38.216 --> 00:12:40.093
Did you try too hard?

00:12:40.301 --> 00:12:43.888
I-I'll be okay. But...

00:12:44.097 --> 00:12:46.724
Dang it... I guess it didn't work.

00:12:53.356 --> 00:12:56.025
Why all the long faces?

00:12:56.234 --> 00:12:58.194
I-I mean...

00:12:58.403 --> 00:13:02.490
Psychics and telepathists actually exist.

00:13:02.699 --> 00:13:06.244
I'm sure we'll be able to communicate
with aliens someday!

00:13:06.452 --> 00:13:11.791
Just look at how many stars are in the sky!

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.835
There's no reason to hurry.

00:13:14.043 --> 00:13:17.672
I'm having plenty of fun being
with all of you, so it's fine.

00:13:20.091 --> 00:13:21.301
Huh?

00:13:29.058 --> 00:13:30.977
"Line up the rocks and
Doofa stootoo ayaabagayari!!"

00:13:32.061 --> 00:13:34.522
"An Unidentified Flying
Object Actually Existed!"

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:36.733
Is this for real?

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:38.651
It actually came?

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:42.322
Wai-- Wh-Wh-What do we do?!
What am I supposed to do?!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:45.908
Y-You're the one who wanted
to meet the aliens, Prez!

00:13:46.117 --> 00:13:48.411
Y-Y-Yeah, b-but...

00:13:49.412 --> 00:13:52.290
--Prez! Behind you! Behind you!
--S-Something's coming!

00:13:52.498 --> 00:13:53.541
That was quick!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:57.086
Uh, I... D-D-Do we have anything?!
Like a bug-catching net?

00:13:57.295 --> 00:13:59.088
Why are you thinking about capturing them?!

00:13:59.297 --> 00:14:02.300
Who knows what'll happen
if we make them mad?!

00:14:07.722 --> 00:14:11.184
Th-This is what aliens look like?

00:14:11.392 --> 00:14:13.061
Thin limbs...

00:14:13.269 --> 00:14:17.190
Giant, developed heads...
Super-smooth skin...

00:14:17.398 --> 00:14:20.068
Humongous, sparkly eyes...

00:14:20.276 --> 00:14:23.571
There's no doubt about it.
They're the real deal!

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:27.033
They really do seem otherworldly...

00:14:27.241 --> 00:14:28.951
I wonder if we can communicate with them.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.288
They have really pretty eyes, though.

00:14:32.497 --> 00:14:33.956
I don't sense any malice.

00:14:34.165 --> 00:14:36.250
It seems like they want to shake hands...

00:14:36.459 --> 00:14:39.587
Wait, with me? I-I'd be honored!

00:14:39.796 --> 00:14:42.965
I can't believe I get to greet them
on behalf of Earth before anyone else!

00:14:43.174 --> 00:14:44.258
Hey, I really wouldn't!

00:14:44.467 --> 00:14:47.387
You never know what kind
of germs they're carrying.

00:14:47.595 --> 00:14:49.347
Master...

00:14:57.605 --> 00:15:00.316
Good for you, President Kurata.

00:15:07.156 --> 00:15:09.575
Apparently, they want to show us
the inside of their spacecraft.

00:15:09.784 --> 00:15:10.660
Really?!

00:15:10.868 --> 00:15:12.662
Sweet! That's awesome!

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:14.664
Let's go, everyone!

00:15:16.999 --> 00:15:20.461
A-Are you sure it's okay to get on?

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.422
I'll go, too.

00:15:25.716 --> 00:15:28.761
In for a penny, in for a pound, I guess...

00:15:51.492 --> 00:15:54.495
This really reminds me of our club room.

00:15:59.041 --> 00:16:02.211
They're, like, super friendly.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:06.048
I sorta figured they'd be kinda scary.

00:16:06.966 --> 00:16:11.137
Prez, it's always been your dream to interact
with extraterrestrial lifeforms, right?

00:16:11.345 --> 00:16:14.891
This is your chance to ask them all kinds
of things with Takenaka as your interpreter!

00:16:15.099 --> 00:16:17.685
Yeah, I think I can make it work.

00:16:18.895 --> 00:16:24.984
R-Right... Um... Uh...

00:16:31.449 --> 00:16:33.576
I can't think of anything.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:37.371
Oh, I know.
Why don't we play some games?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.500
I always have this thing on me.

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:46.714
Nice! Let's show them how it works!

00:17:22.667 --> 00:17:25.670
It's a new year...

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:29.006
All this is going on, yet all I can
think about is the turn of the year

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:33.511
and the late fees for the rental car...

00:17:33.719 --> 00:17:36.180
They're blinding...

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:43.312
Whoa, it's almost morning.
We should head home soon.

00:17:43.521 --> 00:17:44.438
You're right.

00:17:44.647 --> 00:17:48.484
I, at least, told my parents I was spending
the night at a friend's house, but...

00:17:48.693 --> 00:17:52.071
I mean, I guess we're all
friends now anyway.

00:17:54.907 --> 00:17:58.494
All right, let's start wrapping things up.

00:18:05.585 --> 00:18:07.628
I wonder if it's a gift.

00:18:07.837 --> 00:18:10.131
It's so pretty.

00:18:10.339 --> 00:18:14.093
It's a token of their
friendship, apparently.

00:18:17.221 --> 00:18:18.639
They just keep staring.

00:18:18.848 --> 00:18:22.268
Maybe we should give them
something in return?

00:18:22.476 --> 00:18:26.105
Then I'll give them my scarf.

00:18:28.774 --> 00:18:32.695
Um... Then I'll give them this notebook.

00:18:32.903 --> 00:18:35.239
Here's my watch... It's pretty cheap, but...

00:18:35.448 --> 00:18:37.116
You can have my gum.

00:18:37.325 --> 00:18:39.118
Here's this gaming console from Earth.

00:18:39.327 --> 00:18:42.413
Hm... I don't have anything.

00:18:42.622 --> 00:18:46.751
Maybe I can show them some of my powers.

00:18:47.835 --> 00:18:49.462
They seem pretty happy with that.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.881
Oh, that's good.

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:56.927
Uh... Why are you stripping, Reigen-san?

00:18:57.136 --> 00:19:00.931
I was in a hurry this morning,
so I'm still wearing my pajamas underneath.

00:19:02.391 --> 00:19:03.976
You can have this.

00:19:04.185 --> 00:19:05.144
They're very happy.

00:19:05.353 --> 00:19:07.229
I guess anything goes.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:16.697
Thank you so much for coming to see us.

00:19:21.744 --> 00:19:26.332
Well, we'll be on our way now.
Let's meet again someday!

00:19:40.638 --> 00:19:42.848
Hey, the first sunrise of the year.

00:19:44.266 --> 00:19:47.436
I'll never forget today.

00:19:47.645 --> 00:19:51.899
I'm sure everyone else feels
the same... I just know it.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.445
Hey, wait.

00:19:56.654 --> 00:19:58.322
Where's Inukawa?

00:20:09.125 --> 00:20:11.085
New Year's Eve.

00:20:11.293 --> 00:20:14.171
I was taken away by a UFO.

00:20:18.592 --> 00:20:25.599
I'm going to try to convince them
to take me back to Earth.

00:20:25.808 --> 00:20:29.228
But I'm dealing with aliens.

00:20:29.437 --> 00:20:31.480
I can't communicate with them.

00:20:31.689 --> 00:20:33.315
This is probably going to be
a long, drawn-out battle.

