00:20:42.366 --> 00:20:48.706
The next day, they all threw me
a welcome party...? Or something.

00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:54.003
I had no idea what any of this stuff is,
but in the end, I chose something and ate it.

00:20:54.211 --> 00:20:56.839
After that, my memories are a little foggy,

00:20:57.047 --> 00:21:02.136
but I think something insane happened.

00:21:07.266 --> 00:21:13.814
When I came to, I was in another
unfamiliar place, and my head was killing me.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:21.280
That day, I realized just how much
a little bit of gaming time would mean to me.

00:21:21.489 --> 00:21:24.200
But, more importantly, I wanted to go home.

00:21:27.745 --> 00:21:30.581
The inhabitants of this planet
have a natural enemy.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:35.044
It's a savage monster that
tries to eat all of their crops.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:39.673
Despite being such an advanced race,

00:21:39.882 --> 00:21:44.428
they'd never thought of using weapons.

00:21:49.642 --> 00:21:52.520
And so, I took care
of that pest for them.

00:21:53.521 --> 00:21:57.024
It ended up being about the size
of the dog I have back home.

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:11.539
It might be because I slew their monster,
but they treat me like a hero,

00:22:11.747 --> 00:22:17.294
so life on this planet
isn't so bad after all.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:25.761
I have no idea how much
time has passed now.

00:22:31.141 --> 00:22:33.143
Everyone!

00:22:33.352 --> 00:22:35.771
I have something
I need to tell you!

00:22:41.986 --> 00:22:47.950
On the brink of loneliness, Inukawa was
able to link his thoughts with the aliens

00:22:48.158 --> 00:22:52.538
and tell them that he wanted
to go back home to Earth.

00:23:01.881 --> 00:23:06.552
If you have something you want to say,
just look them in the eyes

00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:09.430
and you'll be able to get
through to them.

00:23:09.638 --> 00:23:13.893
Inukawa realized this, but by
the time he got back to Earth,

00:23:14.101 --> 00:23:14.977
most of his memories had
become fuzzy and vague.

